## Supplier code of conduct

Adopt a supplier code aligned with recognized standards, such as:

- International Labour Organization principles;
- UN Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights;
- OECD Due Diligence Guidance;
- Applicable local labor and environmental law;
- Responsible minerals standards;
- Relevant industry-specific standards.

